          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3. The price of a mobile phone is ₹8,250. A GST of 18% is added to the price. Which of the following gives the final price of the phone including the GST?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.216,
            0.452,
            0.346,
            0.473
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(i) 8250 + 18"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.527,
            0.452,
            0.686,
            0.474
          ],
          "content": [
