          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4. The monthly percentage change in population (compared to the previous month) of mice in a lab is given: Month 1 change was +5%, Month 2 change was –2%, and Month 3 change was –3%. Which of the following statement(s) are true? The initial population is p ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 27,
          "bbox": [
            0.21,
            0.64,
            0.827,
            0.661
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(i) The population after three months was "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "p \\times 0 . 0 5 \\times 0 . 0 2 \\times 0 . 0 3 ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 28,
          "bbox": [
            0.203,
            0.665,
            0.827,
            0.685
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(ii) The population after three months was "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "p \\times 1 . 0 5 \\times 0 . 9 8 \\times 0 . 9 7 ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
